WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:06,100
Gu Yuan, do you know the magical herb Dracaena?

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,700
Of course I know. What's wrong?

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:11,020
I saw in the picture that Dragon Blood Algae has a chance of causing the spirit beast to break through and go online.

4
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:13,420
Is it true that it will evolve towards a dragon-type spiritual beast?

5
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:14,900
That's just a rumor

6
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,540
Although it does have advantages

7
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:19,460
But whether it is possible to awaken spiritual beasts? No one has seen it.

8
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:20,900
Something to say

9
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:23,820
The effectiveness of the ninth-level holy product Long-turning Dragon Blood Algae is even stronger

10
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:27,080
100% of the spiritual beasts that can use dragon bloodline can be transformed into dragons

11
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:29,280
As long as I can survive the pain of absorbing the medicine

12
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:31,640
Absorbing dragon's blood algae risks being possessed by purgatory.

13
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:34,520
It will hurt to death if you absorb the ninth-level spiritual grass.

14
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:36,520
Master, I am not the one throwing cold water on you.

15
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:38,920
Our sect’s wild spiritual plants only last four seasons at most.

16
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:40,680
Still growing deep in the back mountains

17
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,200
Spiritual plants of level 4 or above in the medicine garden

18
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:44,320
They were all brought back by the elder Danyangzi to cultivate and plant.

19
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:46,640
The fifth-level dragon blood algae sect cannot be found at all.

20
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:49,760
Even if there are, they will definitely be given priority to the elders or invading disciples.

21
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:51,480
Our handymen can't see it at all

22
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:53,800
If you really want Wuguohu to break through and go online

23
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:56,800
The best possibility is to find Elder Danyangzi, I know.
